Total Changes: 63

[IMP] pos_bancontact_pay: Follow Bancontact branding specifications

..., point_of_sale, pos_self_order, pos_self_order_bancontact_pay, pos_online_payment

*--

Following the rebranding of Payconiq to Bancontact, the QR code design has been updated.
We now use the frames provided by Bancontact and embed the QR code inside them.

Additionally, we prevent sending payment requests with an amount of 0, as Bancontact Pay returns an error in this case.

*--

closes odoo/odoo#261688

